# Skill: Playwright CLI

Purpose:
  Playwright browser automation CLI skill. Provides skills for web testing,
  element interaction, request mocking, session management, and test generation.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @SKILL.md
   3  @references/element-attributes.md
   4  @references/playwright-tests.md

Modes:
  APPLY    — apply Playwright patterns to current task
  REVIEW   — review test suite against best practices
  GENERATE — generate Playwright tests from spec

Rules:
  [PC1] Tests MUST be deterministic and isolated.
  [PC2] Selectors MUST prefer accessibility roles.
  [PC3] Test data MUST be externalized.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    SKILL.md

  Resolve:
    references/element-attributes.md
    references/playwright-tests.md
    references/request-mocking.md
    references/running-code.md
    references/session-management.md
    references/storage-state.md
    references/test-generation.md
    references/tracing.md
    references/video-recording.md

